{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"9cf8076e35a9ff839714044338d20cacc672b9d821789513ef41df1165fd4ca7","digest":{"component_or_area":"MCP server container repo root provisioning","key_entities":[".git","REBAR_ROOT","MCP_CODE_DIR","/app","/var/gerrit/site/mcp-code","origin/main","repo_snapshot.py","gate_source.resolve_gate_handle","review_plan","verify_completion","review_code","reconcile",".dockerignore","Dockerfile.mcp","provision_store"],"problem_keywords":["attested-source gates","git metadata missing","ref resolution","LLM gates unusable","repository provisioning"],"propositions":["Attested-source LLM gates (review_plan, verify_completion, review_code, reconcile) fail with 'cannot resolve ref to a commit' on deployed MCP server because the container root /app lacks git metadata (.git directory).","The snapshot layer defaults to current working directory '.' when repo_root is None, bypassing the configured REBAR_ROOT environment variable that points to a real repository clone.","No plan-review or completion attestation can be earned through the MCP server when gates fail, blocking task/story/epic closure that requires certified verdicts.","The fix requires two parts: (1) provision a real code repository clone at MCP_CODE_DIR with blobless filter, and (2) modify the snapshot layer to consult REBAR_ROOT via repo_root_or_none() before defaulting to '.'.","Live validation confirmed ref resolution now succeeds and gates return verdicts, though attestation signing remains blocked by separate prerequisites (event loop issue in verify pass)."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787888736491141001,"uuid":"c501e8a6-acab-4ec1-80e8-de320a5d81b7"}